1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:03,306
Tukang bangunan di Bali
gali tanah untuk tembok...

2
00:00:03,306 --> 00:00:05,870
malah menemukan peti batu berukir!

3
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,707
Lokasinya dipasangi garis polisi.

4
00:00:07,707 --> 00:00:08,526
Diduga,

5
00:00:08,526 --> 00:00:09,781
ini sarkofagus:

6
00:00:09,781 --> 00:00:11,377
peti mati batu kuno.

7
00:00:11,377 --> 00:00:14,591
Tapi panjangnya cuma 125 sentimeter.

8
00:00:14,591 --> 00:00:15,544
Kok bisa muat?

9
00:00:15,544 --> 00:00:17,112
Di peti sekecil ini,

10
00:00:17,112 --> 00:00:19,009
jenazah biasanya dilipat...

11
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:20,702
seperti bayi dalam kandungan.

12
00:00:20,702 --> 00:00:21,744
Ukirannya...

13
00:00:21,744 --> 00:00:23,595
ternyata mirip wajah manusia!

14
00:00:23,595 --> 00:00:24,340
Konon,

15
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:27,312
wajah seperti ini menjaga
arwah dari roh jahat.

16
00:00:27,312 --> 00:00:27,763
Follow,

17
00:00:27,763 --> 00:00:29,974
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
